{"hymn":"S260","parent":"E319","quality":"exact","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":0},"title":"Fuente de las bendiciones","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—Salvos por gracia","syl":{"n1":["Fuen","i"],"n2":["te","t"],"n3":"de","n4":"las","n5":["ben","i"],"n6":["di","m"],"n7":["cio","m"],"n8":["nes,","t"],"n9":"De","n10":"Tu","n11":["gra","i"],"n12":["cia‿he","t"],"n13":"de","n14":["can","i"],"n15":["tar;","t"],"n16":"Por","n17":"Tu","n18":"gran","n19":["mi","i"],"n20":["se","m"],"n21":["ri","m"],"n22":["cor","m"],"n23":["dia","t"],"n24":["Ten","i"],"n25":["go","t"],"n26":["que‿a","i"],"n27":["la","m"],"n28":["bar","m"],"n29":["te","t"],"n30":"más.","n31":"Yo,","n32":["Se","i"],"n34":["ñor,","t"],"n35":["e","i"],"n36":["ra‿un","t"],"n37":["ex","i"],"n38":["tra","m"],"n40":["ño,","t"],"n41":["Le","i"],"n43":["jos","t"],"n44":"de","n45":"la","n46":"faz","n47":"de","n48":"Dios;","n49":"Mas","n50":"Tu","n51":["san","i"],"n52":["gre","t"],"n53":["re","i"],"n54":["den","m"],"n55":["to","m"],"n56":["ra,","t"],"n57":"Del","n58":["pe","i"],"n59":["li","m"],"n60":["gro","t"],"n61":"me","n62":["sal","i"],"n63":["vó.","t"]},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["Constreñido soy a diario;","De‿esta gracia soy deudor.","Que Tu gracia, como‿un lazo,","Me amarre‿a Ti Señor.","Muéstrame cuán suficiente","Es Tu gracia para hoy,","Mientras canto del profundo,","Inmutable‿amor de Dios."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["Siento que soy muy propenso","A‿apartarme de mi Dios.","Sella‿el corazón, te ruego,","Con Tu‿Espíritu, Señor.","Rescatado del pecado,","Por Tu sangre, Salvador,","Que‿ande como‿un peregrino,","Como hijo real de Dios."]}]}